            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3123] managing pid of interpreters can be missed when interpreter policy is not globally shared</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3123</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If interpreter policy is not set globally, zeppelin use single pid file for interpreters.&lt;br/&gt;
because zeppelin run interpreters multiply with each different port but they are useing same pid in script for running interpreter.&lt;/p&gt;

